Package: sam
Version: 7.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: bash (>= 4.0), dos2unix, moreutils, dc, perl-base, coreutils
Maintainer: Marco A. Rodriguez G. <zopeck@gmail.com>
Description: Search And Move - Smart file searching and deduplication tool
 SAM is an interactive command-line utility designed to catalog, relocate,
 and deduplicate files recursively based on flat-text name comparison lists.
 It handles unconventional filenames (with newlines, spaces, and quotes)
 safely using NUL-delimited streams and low-memory Perl routines.
